-- ============================================================
-- V14: Seed - WA Manufactured Home Lot Lease packet
-- Rewritten from 'WA 2024 Lease All COPY.docx': spelling fixed, every deal
-- figure a token, and one clause per method wherever the deal can go more than
-- one way (term end, rent schedule, late fee, returned checks, rule-violation
-- fee, deposit, and each utility). Numbers are assigned at freeze, never typed;
-- cross-references are {{ref:<uuid>}}. Clauses with a note need legal review.
-- ============================================================

